<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Dead_Room_by_Shadow5973">Dead Room by Shadow5973</span></h2>
<ul><li> <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1901">Dragon Age Nexus project page</a></b></li></ul>
<p>There are two bedrooms connected by a short hallway with a body in each of the rooms. There is also a doorway in each room where they can be attached to a larger building interior. The bedrooms could be used for part of the inside of a house or similar building after an attack by bandits or darkspawn.
</p><p>NOTE: 
This a .sel file to be imported into the toolset.
</p><p>This room uses interior lighting, so this page might be helpful: <a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="http://social.bioware.com/forum/1/topic/74/index/4700291">http://social.bioware.com/forum/1/topic/74/index/4700291</a>
</p>
<pre><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Image%201.png"><img alt="Image 1.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/4/45/Image_1.png" width="400" height="222" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/4/45/Image_1.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/4/45/Image_1.png 2x" /></a>
