<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Vigil_Suite_by_Bloodsong">Vigil Suite by Bloodsong</span></h2>
<ul><li> <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1922">Dragon Age Nexus project page</a></b> </li></ul>
<p>This is a suite of rooms as I imagined for the commander of Vigil Keep.  It has a large master living quarters with semi-private sleeping and dressing area, a guest room, and a connecting bath.  It features both sloped and flat ceilings, large windows, a whole lot of clutter and lived-in-ness, and practical aspects such as 'trash can' vases, the shared chimney between rooms as heating source for the bath, and the height of luxury: the indoor commode!
</p><p><br />
<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20VigilSuite-m-commd.jpg" title="Master Living Quarters"><img alt="Master Living Quarters" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/a/a3/VigilSuite-m-commd.jpg" width="400" height="250" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/a/a3/VigilSuite-m-commd.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/a/a3/VigilSuite-m-commd.jpg 2x" /></a> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20VigilSuite-g-room.jpg" title="Guest Room"><img alt="Guest Room" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/5/56/VigilSuite-g-room.jpg" width="400" height="250" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/5/56/VigilSuite-g-room.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/5/56/VigilSuite-g-room.jpg 2x" /></a>
</p><p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg" title="Bath Washstand"><img alt="Bath Washstand" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/1/19/VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg/400px-VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg" width="400" height="250" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/1/19/VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg/600px-VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/1/19/VigilSuite-b-wash.jpg 2x" /></a> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg" title="The Commander&#39;s Desk"><img alt="The Commander&#39;s Desk" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/01/VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg/400px-VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg" width="400" height="250" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/01/VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg/600px-VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/0/01/VigilSuite-m-desk.jpg 2x" /></a>
