<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Estate_Dormitory_by_BlackPhi">Estate Dormitory by BlackPhi</span></h2>
<ul><li> <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1925">Dragon Age Nexus project page</a></b> </li></ul>
<p>Workers on a large estate needs somewhere to sleep. Basic and not too comfortable - lest the workers get lazy - but functional. This dormitory is for them. The dormitory is furnished, in a non-luxurious kind of way, but spaces have been left for adding chests and/or cupboards during area creation.
</p><p>Given suitable placeables this could also be a barracks; indeed put three such rooms on three sides of a square and you have the core of an army camp, although who in Ferelden would want such a camp, and why, is an interesting question.
</p><p>Again, it could easily be the dortoir of a small monastic community.
</p><p><br />
<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Bp%20dorm%20beds.jpg" title="Lots of Beds"><img alt="Lots of Beds" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/f/f2/Bp_dorm_beds.jpg" width="400" height="282" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/f/f2/Bp_dorm_beds.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/f/f2/Bp_dorm_beds.jpg 2x" /></a>  <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Bp%20dorm%20fire.jpg" title="A Small Fire"><img alt="A Small Fire" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/0e/Bp_dorm_fire.jpg/400px-Bp_dorm_fire.jpg" width="400" height="320" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/0e/Bp_dorm_fire.jpg/600px-Bp_dorm_fire.jpg 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/0e/Bp_dorm_fire.jpg/800px-Bp_dorm_fire.jpg 2x" /></a>
</p>
